    "description": "The 19 presidential tickets INEC displayed for 2027 (Form EC9, 2026-08-02), one campaign each. Consumed by scripts/seed-campaigns.ts: find-or-creates the candidate and running mate as nigerian_officials, anchors the ticket on an official_elections row, then upserts campaigns + campaign_documents + campaign_media by slug. Re-runs are idempotent.",
